<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>滚动闭环把「求解一次」变成「持续服务」</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02 方法 · 滚动层</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>周期时序</Text><Box style={{width: 170, minHeight: 44, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>到达入池</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 170, minHeight: 44, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>① 任务选择</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 170, minHeight: 44, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>② MUAS 求解</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 170, minHeight: 44, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>③ 执行出动</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 170, minHeight: 44, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>④ 反馈更新</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 574, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务池演化与池水位守恒</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>T(t+1) = remain ∪ new ∪ release；arrived = done + unreach + elim + remain。滞留任务带等待补偿参与下周期排序，不静默丢失。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 574, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>机队状态每周期重算</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>状态(u) = 停靠机巢 + 剩余航程 + 可用性；起降、充电、故障与返航迁移改变可用集。充电中的机是幻影容量，不计入 B(t) 与 cap(t)。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 574, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>完成闸门：完成率不说谎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>迟到交付仍计完成、计全额奖励；物理不可行才解绑回池，下周期重选。唯一合法未完成原因是几何永久不可达，与「服务休眠」严格分账。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 574, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>事件触发与状态回贯</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>UAV 故障、突发高优先级任务、机巢不可用触发本周期重规划；cap(t) 与选择优先级吃进跨周期状态。几何可达但连续够不着的任务转 DORMANT，条件恢复即唤醒。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>对比事件驱动「从零重建」：增量重解保住连续性、降低单周期重规划规模，任务暂缓不是丢失。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', paddingLeft: 13, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>收敛停机口径：主判据为「池空」——到达全部注入后，池内不存在「能被完成却没被完成」的任务即自然收敛。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>09 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>